01:02:52.400 --> 01:02:57.400
So the previous month was actually a
genuine peak.

01:02:57.400 --> 01:03:11.400
At troughs and peaks, the next move, the
next month, doesn't confirm that the
previous month is definitely a trough or a
peak.

01:03:11.400 --> 01:03:21.400
What it does do is tell us that there's a
very high potential that it could be a
peak, and we adjust our bias accordingly.

01:03:21.400 --> 01:03:42.400
